---
/* ThirdSection.astro - Reconstrucción fluida para todas las resoluciones */
---

<section
    class="relative overflow-hidden bg-transparent w-full"
>
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 pointer-events-none">
        <div
            class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-[80%] h-[70%] bg-[#A67233]/10 blur-[120px] rounded-full mix-blend-screen opacity-30"
        >
        </div>
        <div
            class="absolute -bottom-[15%] left-[-10%] w-[70%] h-[70%] bg-[#D96E48]/10 blur-[130px] rounded-full mix-blend-soft-light"
        >
        </div>
        <div
            class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#592D23]/30 via-transparent to-[#592D23]/50 opacity-80"
        >
        </div>
    </div>

    <div
        class="max-w-[1400px] mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center relative z-20"
    >
        <!-- COLUMNA IMAGEN (Orden 1 en móvil, Orden 1 en escritorio) -->
        <div
            class="relative group w-full max-w-[600px] mx-auto lg:max-w-full order-1"
        >
            <div
                class="absolute -inset-10 bg-[#D96E48]/5 blur-[90px] rounded-full opacity-20 transition-opacity duration-1000"
            >
            </div>

            <div
                class="relative overflow-hidden shadow-[0_0_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)] border border-[#A67233]/20 bg-[#0D0D0D]"
            >
                <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 z-10 shadow-[inset_0_0_100px_rgba(13,13,13,0.8)] pointer-events-none"
                >
                </div>

                <img
                    src="/GreedFall/GreedFall_TheDyingWorld_Screenshot01.png"
                    alt="GreedFall Community Legacy"
                    class="w-full h-auto object-cover opacity-80 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-all duration-1000"
                />

                <div
                    class="absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.08] mix-blend-overlay bg-[url('https://grainy-gradients.vercel.app/noise.svg')] pointer-events-none"
                >
                </div>
            </div>

            <div
                class="absolute -left-6 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-2 opacity-20"
            >
                <div
                    class="w-px h-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#D99B66] to-transparent"
                >
                </div>
                <span
                    class="rotate-90 font-cinzel text-[9px] tracking-[0.5em] text-[#D99B66]"
                    >2.0M+</span
                >
                <div
                    class="w-px h-24 bg-gradient-to-b from-transparent via-[#D99B66] to-transparent"
                >
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- COLUMNA TEXTO (Orden 2 en móvil, Orden 2 en escritorio) -->
        <div
            class="flex flex-col space-y-6 lg:space-y-8 relative order-2 text-left"
        >
            <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
                <span
                    class="font-cinzel text-xs tracking-[0.5em] text-[#A67233] uppercase"
                    >Un Legado Imparable</span
                >
                <div
                    class="h-[1px] w-20 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#A67233]/40 to-transparent"
                >
                </div>
            </div>

            <h2
                class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl xl:text-6xl font-cinzel font-bold leading-[1.1] text-[#F2E6D8]/90"
            >
                Dos Millones de <br />
                <span
                    class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-[#D99B66] via-[#A67233] to-[#592D23]"
                >
                    Almas Conquistadas
                </span>
            </h2>

            <p
                class="text-[#F2E6D8]/70 text-base md:text-lg lg:text-xl font-serif italic leading-relaxed max-w-xl"
            >
                El regreso de la licencia GreedFall, que ha conquistado a <span
                    class="text-[#D99B66] not-italic font-cinzel font-bold underline decoration-[#A67233]/40 underline-offset-8"
                    >más de 2 millones</span
                > de jugadores y cuya comunidad espera impaciente un nuevo título.
            </p>

            <div
                class="flex items-center gap-4 opacity-30 group cursor-default pt-4"
            >
                <div
                    class="w-10 h-10 border border-[#A67233] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center group-hover:rotate-90 transition-transform duration-1000"
                >
                    <div class="w-1 h-1 bg-[#D99B66] rounded-full"></div>
                </div>
                <span
                    class="font-cinzel text-[10px] tracking-widest text-[#F2E6D8]"
                    >ESTADÍSTICAS OFICIALES // TEER FRADEE</span
                >
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

<div class="flex justify-center w-full mt-10">
  <a
    href="#buy-now"
    class="group relative px-10 py-4 overflow-hidden border border-[#A67E5B]/40 bg-[#1D2F40]/40 backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-500 block"
  >
    <div
      class="absolute inset-0 bg-[#A67E5B]/5 group-hover:bg-[#A67E5B]/20 transition-colors"
    >
    </div>
    
    <span
      class="relative z-10 text-[#F2E6D8] font-cinzel text-xs tracking-[0.3em] uppercase"
    >
      Compra ya
    </span>

    <div
      class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-t border-r border-[#A67E5B]"
    >
    </div>

    <div
      class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-2.5 h-2.5 border-b border-l border-[#A67E5B]"
    >
    </div>
  </a>
</div>
</section>